# 💰 Expense Tracker Web App

A simple full-stack web application for tracking and managing personal expenses.

## ✨ Features

- Add new expenses
- View expense records
- Edit expense details
- Delete expenses
- Categorize expenses
- Track total spending
- Monthly expense summary
- Responsive web interface

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- Python
- Flask
- SQLite
- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

## 🎯 Project Purpose

This project demonstrates how Flask and SQLite can be used to build a web-based application for managing and analyzing expense data.

